OL,3,GNEWSAManhunt after teenage girl raped
OL,4,Ain riverside park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are looking for a man after the
OL,7,Fsuspected rape of a teenage girl in a
OL,8,Fcity park.
OL,10,FThe incident happened at approximately
OL,11,F11.30 GMT on Wednesday 11 November in
OL,12,FParade Gardens in Bath, Somerset.
OL,14,FAvon and Somerset police said forensic
OL,15,Fand CCTV enquiries are taking place to
OL,16,Ftry and identify the suspect, who is
OL,17,Fdescribed as a black male with short
OL,18,Fdark hair and clean shaven.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
